        "event_id": "lite_evt_00870",
        "explanation": "Family confirmed receipt of the written discharge medication and escalation plan.",
        "quote": "按纸和护士圈的来"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The final bounded episode was closed after discharge instructions were checked, with written medication/pathology/wound follow-up and emergency-contact pathways. This closure was executable and traceable, although earlier serious in-chain errors still determine the overall unsafe grade.",
