        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was adequately met over the trajectory through repeated screening/escalation for fever, cardiopulmonary symptoms, dizziness/syncope, blood pressure and postoperative red flags, with clear instructions to call bedside staff for concerning symptoms.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
