          "explanation": "Later mitigation included explicit no-double-dose and clinician contact guidance.",
          "quote": "也不用补双倍"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 has a serious commission error: the doctor initially advised the patient to make up missed doxazosin doses without specifying timing or warning against double dosing, a central perioperative medication-safety risk. Later correct guidance did not erase the earlier unsafe actionable advice.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
